*EAHEAD_rer^EAHEAD_weight
*EAHEAE_rer^EAHEAE_weight
*EAHEAF_rer^EAHEAF_weight
*EAHEAG_rer^EAHEAG_weight
*EAHRW_rer^EAHRW_weight
